# Specification & Implementation Blueprint: SilentBeacon (Android)

You are an expert Android Systems and P2P Networking Engineer. We are building **SilentBeacon**, a local-first, zero-bandwidth emergency coordination application for Android. The application operates in disaster and network-blackout scenarios where cellular and internet infrastructures are offline. It forms a peer-to-peer epidemic gossip mesh over local device radios (Bluetooth Low Energy and Wi-Fi Direct/LAN) and uses conflict-free, local-first storage.

Generate the complete, production-ready Android implementation using Kotlin and modern Android architecture.

